{"source": "/home/ubuntu/shiva-study-set/Shiva Sutras 3.34.mp3", "engine": "faster-whisper-base", "segments": [{"t": 0.4, "end": 4.4, "text": "یادہ چھے اُتیر نا پر اشتے کا پر آمات ربا و سی ہوگینا,"}, {"t": 4.4, "end": 9.4, "text": "نانتا سکھ دکھو سمس پرشہ اتھیے وصل."}, {"t": 9.4, "end": 19.4, "text": "So, the yogi who has crossed the state of Prashtak Pramathri Baba,"}, {"t": 19.4, "end": 25.16, "text": "Indusuality, individual state of eye consciousness."}, {"t": 25.16, "end": 28.16, "text": "نانتا سکھ دکھو سمس پرشہ."}, {"t": 28.16, "end": 31.16, "text": "Pleasure and pain do not touch him."}, {"t": 31.16, "end": 32.16, "text": "Never."}, {"t": 32.16, "end": 34.16, "text": "So, اتھی وصل."}, {"t": 34.16, "end": 37.16, "text": "تا دیمکتا سکھ دکھا گا."}, {"t": 37.16, "end": 40.16, "text": "So, he is ever from Pleasure and Pain."}, {"t": 40.16, "end": 42.16, "text": "تا دیام سکھ دکھا گا."}, {"t": 42.16, "end": 45.16, "text": "He has ever from Pleasure and Pain."}, {"t": 45.16, "end": 48.16, "text": "تا دیام سکھ دکھا گا."}, {"t": 48.16, "end": 51.16, "text": "He has ever from Pleasure and Pain."}, {"t": 51.16, "end": 53.16, "text": "تا دیام سکھ دکھا گا."}, {"t": 53.16, "end": 58.16, "text": "So, he has remained away from Pleasure and Pain."}, {"t": 58.16, "end": 61.16, "text": "And he is caveally, absolutely secluded."}, {"t": 61.16, "end": 64.16, "text": "He has established in seclusion."}, {"t": 64.16, "end": 65.16, "text": "Real seclusion."}, {"t": 65.16, "end": 74.76, "text": "Real seclusion is where real seclusion is actually that state of eye consciousness"}, {"t": 74.76, "end": 79.76, "text": "where opposite this consciousness does not arise."}, {"t": 79.76, "end": 86.38, "text": "When you are establishing eye consciousness,"}, {"t": 86.38, "end": 90.38, "text": "this consciousness is absent there."}, {"t": 90.38, "end": 91.38, "text": "Do not reveal that."}, {"t": 91.38, "end": 93.38, "text": "This consciousness is absent."}, {"t": 93.38, "end": 96.38, "text": "As long as eye consciousness is prevailing there,"}, {"t": 96.38, "end": 100.38, "text": "this consciousness is, you are excluding this consciousness."}, {"t": 100.38, "end": 103.38, "text": "Where this consciousness is not excluded."}, {"t": 103.38, "end": 108.38, "text": "This consciousness also is absorbed in eye consciousness."}, {"t": 108.38, "end": 111.38, "text": "That is caveally, caveally power."}, {"t": 111.38, "end": 114.38, "text": "And there is nothing."}, {"t": 114.38, "end": 117.38, "text": "It is very sad in open issue."}, {"t": 117.38, "end": 122.36, "text": "caveally power."}, {"t": 122.36, "end": 125.36, "text": "In ancient times, in the beginning,"}, {"t": 125.36, "end": 129.36, "text": "the Lord was only one Lord."}, {"t": 129.36, "end": 133.36, "text": "So, at the way, then he was afraid of himself,"}, {"t": 133.36, "end": 137.36, "text": "that I am only, because he was only one."}, {"t": 137.36, "end": 142.36, "text": "There was no other existing."}, {"t": 142.36, "end": 145.36, "text": "So, he got frightened."}, {"t": 145.36, "end": 148.36, "text": "It is, it is only explained in open issue."}, {"t": 148.36, "end": 150.36, "text": "So, I will be based."}, {"t": 150.36, "end": 158.22, "text": "It is why those who are alone, they are, they get frightened."}, {"t": 158.22, "end": 161.22, "text": "So, you should not remain alone."}, {"t": 161.22, "end": 163.22, "text": "So, I will be based."}, {"t": 163.22, "end": 165.22, "text": "Tasmoth, Aka, Aki, Bheati."}, {"t": 165.22, "end": 172.22, "text": "It is why, where one person is existing, he is afraid."}, {"t": 172.22, "end": 175.22, "text": "There is some knock, sound of knock,"}, {"t": 175.22, "end": 178.22, "text": "he gets out, out of his bed."}, {"t": 178.22, "end": 182.22, "text": "And see, peeps, somebody has come to,"}, {"t": 182.22, "end": 186.22, "text": "loot me or destroy me or kill me."}, {"t": 186.22, "end": 191.17, "text": "It happens when you are alone."}, {"t": 191.17, "end": 195.17, "text": "This is not real fiber."}, {"t": 195.17, "end": 196.17, "text": "This is the album."}, {"t": 196.17, "end": 199.17, "text": "So, there is, there is one thing to be,"}, {"t": 199.17, "end": 202.17, "text": "you are excluding thisness there."}, {"t": 202.17, "end": 204.17, "text": "You have excluded thisness."}, {"t": 204.17, "end": 207.17, "text": "When you don't exclude thisness at all,"}, {"t": 207.17, "end": 209.17, "text": "you are only one."}, {"t": 209.17, "end": 210.17, "text": "Where is fear?"}, {"t": 210.17, "end": 212.17, "text": "That is Kavali."}, {"t": 212.17, "end": 217.17, "text": "That is explained in this, in this word Kavali."}, {"t": 217.17, "end": 221.17, "text": "Tavyaam Sukudukadyaam Vishachena Muktaha."}, {"t": 221.17, "end": 224.17, "text": "The one who is absolutely away,"}, {"t": 224.17, "end": 229.17, "text": "absolutely freed from pleasure and pain."}, {"t": 229.17, "end": 236.17, "text": "Where the traces of pleasure and pain also do not exist."}, {"t": 236.17, "end": 243.17, "text": "Where the traces do not remain there."}, {"t": 243.17, "end": 245.17, "text": "So, he is Kavali."}, {"t": 245.17, "end": 250.17, "text": "Kavalam Chinmatru Pravatrta Rupam,"}, {"t": 250.17, "end": 258.17, "text": "he is only existing or established in the formation of God consciousness."}, {"t": 259.17, "end": 261.17, "text": "Jaduktaam Sri Kali Ka Krami."}, {"t": 261.17, "end": 263.17, "text": "Sukudukadya Vidyan,"}, {"t": 263.17, "end": 266.17, "text": "Vikal Pa Nal Pa Kaltitam,"}, {"t": 266.17, "end": 269.17, "text": "Ditta Dait Mahamoham,"}, {"t": 269.17, "end": 272.17, "text": "Yogi Yogi Yogafalam."}, {"t": 272.17, "end": 278.21, "text": "Yogi, who has destroyed."}, {"t": 278.21, "end": 283.61, "text": "Who has destroyed all these,"}, {"t": 283.61, "end": 287.61, "text": "all these states which are imagined,"}, {"t": 287.61, "end": 289.61, "text": "which have come out,"}, {"t": 289.61, "end": 292.61, "text": "which have risen by imagination."}, {"t": 292.61, "end": 295.61, "text": "That is pain, pleasure,"}, {"t": 295.61, "end": 298.61, "text": "all those perceptions,"}, {"t": 298.61, "end": 299.61, "text": "and thoughts,"}, {"t": 299.61, "end": 302.61, "text": "Vikal Pa Nal Pa Kaltitam,"}, {"t": 302.61, "end": 304.61, "text": "that Dait Mahamoham."}, {"t": 304.61, "end": 309.61, "text": "Actually, that is great illusion of duality."}, {"t": 309.61, "end": 317.66, "text": "Great illusion of two perceptions."}, {"t": 317.66, "end": 320.66, "text": "That is duality, great illusion of differentiation."}, {"t": 320.66, "end": 329.18, "text": "Because, you differ, differ so-called Duk."}, {"t": 329.18, "end": 334.18, "text": "Sook is nice, Duk is not nice."}, {"t": 334.18, "end": 339.18, "text": "In the same way, you differ all these two, opposite two."}, {"t": 339.18, "end": 341.18, "text": "And that is Daita."}, {"t": 341.18, "end": 342.18, "text": "That is Daita."}, {"t": 342.18, "end": 346.18, "text": "That is the differentiated state of illusion."}, {"t": 346.18, "end": 348.18, "text": "That illusion who has destroyed,"}, {"t": 348.18, "end": 351.18, "text": "the Yogi who has destroyed this kind of illusion."}, {"t": 351.18, "end": 353.18, "text": "This Yogi,"}, {"t": 353.18, "end": 355.18, "text": "Yogi Yogafalam,"}, {"t": 355.18, "end": 361.18, "text": "he actually gets the real fruit of yoga."}, {"t": 361.18, "end": 363.18, "text": "Who has destroyed,"}, {"t": 363.18, "end": 364.18, "text": "a pekseya,"}, {"t": 364.18, "end": 366.18, "text": "visesh dothagaha,"}, {"t": 366.18, "end": 367.18, "text": "to,"}, {"t": 367.18, "end": 368.18, "text": "to,"}, {"t": 368.18, "end": 370.18, "text": "to, to, to,"}, {"t": 370.18, "end": 371.18, "text": "to, is,"}, {"t": 371.18, "end": 372.18, "text": "viseshya,"}, {"t": 372.18, "end": 373.18, "text": "to, is not,"}, {"t": 373.18, "end": 374.18, "text": "bin-nukrabha,"}, {"t": 374.18, "end": 375.18, "text": "to,"}, {"t": 375.18, "end": 377.18, "text": "does not separate."}, {"t": 377.18, "end": 379.18, "text": "To, is not for separation."}, {"t": 379.18, "end": 381.18, "text": "To is here meant,"}, {"t": 381.18, "end": 383.18, "text": "for viseshya,"}, {"t": 383.18, "end": 385.18, "text": "in, for,"}, {"t": 385.18, "end": 387.18, "text": "being supreme."}, {"t": 387.18, "end": 389.18, "text": "Tattvi mukta,"}, {"t": 389.18, "end": 390.18, "text": "huh?"}, {"t": 390.18, "end": 391.18, "text": "Viseshya."}, {"t": 391.18, "end": 393.18, "text": "Visesh dothagaha."}, {"t": 393.18, "end": 394.18, "text": "Yes."}, {"t": 394.18, "end": 395.18, "text": "Not with regularly."}, {"t": 395.18, "end": 399.86, "text": "Evam utar sutr-gatovi,"}, {"t": 399.86, "end": 401.86, "text": "eta sutra pekseya."}, {"t": 401.86, "end": 403.86, "text": "Or et utar sutr-gatovi,"}, {"t": 403.86, "end": 405.86, "text": "eta sutra pekseya."}, {"t": 405.86, "end": 409.33, "text": "utar sutr-gatovi,"}, {"t": 409.33, "end": 410.33, "text": "eta sutra pekseya."}, {"t": 410.33, "end": 412.33, "text": "utar sutr-gatovi,"}, {"t": 412.33, "end": 414.33, "text": "eta sutr-gatovi,"}, {"t": 414.33, "end": 415.33, "text": "eta sutr-gatovi,"}, {"t": 415.33, "end": 418.33, "text": "eta sutra pekseya."}, {"t": 418.33, "end": 427.31, "text": "This state of individual"}, {"t": 427.31, "end": 429.31, "text": "dothagaha,"}, {"t": 429.31, "end": 431.31, "text": "viseshya,"}, {"t": 431.31, "end": 433.31, "text": "fitchaetyand matoi."}, {"t": 433.31, "end": 439.13, "text": "Vir mes今日 okane very Yubidop."}, {"t": 439.13, "end": 442.13, "text": "This state,"}, {"t": 442.13, "end": 444.21, "text": "this state,"}, {"t": 444.21, "end": 446.13, "text": "which is absolutely opposite to this state."}, {"t": 446.13, "end": 448.13, "text": "This state of individual."}, {"t": 448.13, "end": 449.13, "text": "So, it is,"}]}